<title>THAILAND: Serm Suk 1996 net profit falls 12.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Serm Suk 1996 net profit falls 12.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		23.55     vs	   27.04</p>
<p>    Net			612.31     vs	  703.14</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is The Serm Suk Plc, a licensed Pepsi and other softdrink bottler in Thailand.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950-3</p>
